OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dog wins crimefighting duo
OL,4,Aaward with handler
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police dog who began life as a
OL,7,F"skinny stray" before joining the force
OL,8,Fand helping with more than 100 arrests
OL,9,Fhas won an award from a national dog
OL,10,Fwelfare charity.
OL,12,FBoss, a four-year-old German shepherd,
OL,13,Fhas been honoured alongside his handler
OL,14,FPC Daniel Carter, 32, from Medway in
OL,15,FKent, with the Crimefighting Duo Award
OL,16,Ffrom the Thin Blue Paw Foundation.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
