OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPolice dog wins crimefighting duo
OL,4,Aaward with handler
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoss, who has now retired from duties
OL,7,Fdue to arthritis, was picked up by a
OL,8,Fdog warden in Norfolk in 2023 before
OL,9,Fjoining Kent Police, where then-rookie
OL,10,Fdog handler Carter was starting his
OL,11,Finitial training.
OL,13,FCarter said: "I never truly understood
OL,14,Fwhat it felt like to love an animal. He
OL,15,Fchanged that completely."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
